------------------- here is a complete game ----------------
dax$ ./chess 
                                 
 I AM THE APOLLO CHESS PLAYER.   
                                 
 ENTER 'P' TO PRINT THE BOARD    
 ENTER 'M' TO LIST VALID MOVES   
 ENTER 'R' TO RESIGN             
 ENTER 'K' TO CASTLE KING'S SIDE 
 ENTER 'Q' TO CASTLE QUEEN'S SIDE
 ENTER MOVES IN THE FORM 'E7E5'. 
                                 
 WILL YOU MOVE FIRST (Y/N)?      
y
